 "title": "The Cancelled Boat Race",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🚣",
 "sentences": [
  "The 2020 Boat Race never happened.",
  "This famous rowing competition between Oxford and Cambridge was scheduled for March 29.",
  "The cancellation was caused by the COVID-19 pandemic in the United Kingdom.",
  "It was the first men’s race cancellation since 1845, excluding World War I and II.",
  "This also marked the first cancellation of the women’s race since its 1964 revival.",
  "The event would have featured female umpires for both senior races."
